        {
            "key": "pk_faqs",
            "scope": "packaging-design",
            "items": [
                [
                    "What are packaging design services, and what do they include?",
                    "Packaging design services encompass activities such as design of packaging, revisions on current packaging designs and artwork, and preparation of the design for printing. Services may include label design, packaging launch, artwork revision, pre-press assistance, and file preparation. The objective is to ensure that your packaging design is perfect and production-ready."
                ],
                [
                    "How do I choose the right packaging design company?",
                    "Look for a team that understands both the creative and the technical side of packaging: one that designs the artwork, adapts it across SKUs, and prepares print-ready files, working with you and your printers for consistent, on-time delivery."
                ],
                [
                    "Do you offer custom box packaging design for unique product shapes?",
                    "Yes. Our packaging design services include custom box packaging design, packaging concepts, and product mockups and 3D visualizations so you can see the result before production."
                ],
                [
                    "What makes a luxury packaging design agency different from a standard one?",
                    "Technical accuracy and consistency. Luxury packaging depends on precise artwork, brand identity integration and production-ready files that hold up through approval, pre-press and printing without delay."
                ],
                [
                    "Do you provide product label design along with packaging design?",
                    "Yes. Product label design is part of our packaging design services, alongside custom packaging, packaging rollout and pre-press."
                ],
                [
                    "Can you redesign our existing packaging instead of starting from scratch?",
                    "Yes. We handle package redesigns as well as new product launches, adapting approved artwork across multiple SKUs, variants, languages and packaging formats."
                ]
            ]
        },
